|GKB============================== Poison Dart ===============================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: cpoison dart                                                 |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   This will coat a dart with a potent poison that will slow down an    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   enemy's reflexes. Darts can be purchased from a vendor within the    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   guild. Like most things, higher levels of training will produce      |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   better results.                                                      |GKB=
